GemCraft Zero Auto Mana Trainer

A portable trainer for GemCraft Legacy Collection — Chapter Zero: Gem of Eternity on Windows x64.

The program reads your current and maximum mana during gameplay. Press Start to automatically refill mana to 95% of the current maximum whenever it drops below 50%.

Features

Live display of current and maximum mana.

Automatic mana refill — checked every 0.25 seconds.

Start / Stop controls.

10 interface languages with a flag selector.

Standalone EXE — no Python installation or additional libraries required.

How to use

Launch Chapter Zero through GemCraft Legacy Collection and enter a map.

Run the trainer.

Press Find GemCraft,

Press Connect and Read,

Press Start to enable automatic mana refill.

Press Stop to disable it.

Version: 0.1.1
Platform: Windows x64
